{"version":1,"content":"<p>俄羅斯周四（29日）以無人機襲擊烏克蘭城市第聶伯羅（Dnipro）一個人流密集的火車月台，造成最少14人死亡；</p><p>另外兩個地方城市同日遇襲，導致5人死亡；</p><p>首都基輔晚上較後時間遭導彈攻擊，再有1人喪生。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T01:21:14.438748+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":100,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T00:49:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T01:38:13.451767+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T01:18:10.453361+00:00","content_hash":"ec7d3173d0e0246d27b4935d283a7e7b6e486981e5baf5d8468c815aa13a3cbd","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}